WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Hiring costs more than the salary.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:07.700
For each person, you pay the salary plus 68% in payroll charges.

3
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:11.700
You recruit, hire, train, track their hours.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.600
If demand grows, the cycle starts over.

5
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.300
And you're the one managing all of it.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.000
With me, you don't manage people.

7
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:24.700
Send the request by text or voice, like you would to an employee you trust.

8
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:30.200
I split it into tasks, pick the right specialist and review everything before delivering.

9
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.400
The team works at any hour, no absences and no delays.

10
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.000
And none of them goes on your payroll.
